        }
      ],
      "hcontainers": [],
      "note": "Constitution of 4 October 1958. 16 Titres, 89 Articles. Articles numbered continuously through all Titres. No Chapitres at constitutional level. Preamble references the 1946 Constitution preamble and 1789 Declaration."
    },
